<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Cocoa, Fla., at 1615 EDT.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Cocoa, Fla., at 1615 EDT.</headline>
<text>
<p>CITY OF COCOA, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $27,500,000</p>
<p>WATER AND SEWER SYSTEM</p>
<p>IMPROVEMENT REVENUE BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
